<title>MALAYSIA: Olympia stock rises on requotation.</title>
<headline>Olympia stock rises on requotation.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Olympia Industries Bhd were up nine cents to 2.30 ringgit on requotation after a two-week suspension.</p>
<p>Around four minutes into the opening, the stock was up 14 cents to 2.35 as 845,000 shares were traded.  </p>
<p>The property and gaming firm on Monday said it was buying a prime piece of land for residential development in Kuala Lumpur for 750 million ringgit.</p>
<p>The purchase for the 35.2 hectares would be paid for by cash and new Olympia share issues.</p>
</text>
